Reference (no code copied)
--------------------------
The approach of this module (which engines to use for legacy HWP and DOC
files, and returning text per paragraph for AI use) was informed by the
`packages/file-parse` package of IeumOffice (이음오피스),
https://github.com/pblsketch/openoffice, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. No source code from IeumOffice is included in this repository.
We thank the IeumOffice authors for publishing their work as open source.

